<title>INDIA: Two Israelis among eight dead in India bus mishap.</title>
<headline>Two Israelis among eight dead in India bus mishap.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Israeli nationals were among eight people killed and 20 injured when a bus fell into a deep gorge in a remote area of the northern state of Himachal Pradesh on Sunday, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said.</p>
<p>The news agency said the incident occured at Sarsari in the remote Kulu district, some 140 km (90 miles), from state capital Simla.</p>
